OL,4,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from St Davids Cathedral,
OL,6,     Gwith music by Tomkins and Tallis.
OL,7,G1900FSunday Feature: The Messy Guide
OL,8,     Fto AI
OL,9,     GComposer Jennifer Walshe explores
OL,10,     Gthe philosophical and aesthetic
OL,11,     Gquestions that AI raises for how
OL,12,     Gwe make, listen to and think
OL,13,     Gabout music.
OL,14,G1945FWords and Music
OL,15,     GWords about Marilyn Monroe, Helen
OL,16,     Gof Troy and a host of other
OL,17,     Gbeauties both real and imagined
OL,18,     Gby Sappho, Austen, Oscar Wilde.
OL,19,     GAnd music to match from
OL,20,     GTchaikovsky, Bach, Judith Weir.
